(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ch-15"] = {"441501101":[["","XC 119, March 5. Sunset Valley Military Base."],["Grant","Sunset Valley Base... The last time I came here, I was a machinist in the 7th Mobile."],["Grant","Those three years sure flew by... still the same old place, but—"],["","Grant cast his gaze towards the hangar not far away, where soldiers in various uniforms were busily moving back and forth."],["UNCS Machinist","6th Mobile Unit, your STs have all been serviced and are ready for deployment!"],["UNCS Soldier","Hmm? Good to hear! But there's bad news—our recon drone was just hit by enemy fire. 'Fraid well have to ask you to do a bit of overtime."],["UNCS Machinist","What? Sigh... alright, bring it in quickly!"],["Grant","I thought West Milkhama was mostly peaceful, but it seems the military hasn't settled down at all."],["Dana","It seems the joint op against the rebels isn't going quite as planned."],["Natalia","If it were just the rebel forces, they wouldn't be much of a threat. By the looks of it, they've made some new friends."],["Dana","Are you referring to Goman?"],["Natalia","Goman is tough, but alone he's manageable. We believe there may be others behind the scenes."],["Natalia","To make matters worse, the DL's no longer playing coy. They're making regular incursions into the border buffer zone to test our limits."],["Natalia","No one can guarantee that the situation won't continue to deteriorate. The NDF must maintain a certain level of combat readiness."],["","While talking, they reached the entrance of the fourth hangar, the deepest part."],["","The security door was not completely closed. From inside came the muffled voice of a man, straining to contain his anger."],["","I've told you, the current parameters are the optimal values within the safety range! Forcing further increases will be counterproductive!"],["","Maybe you can withstand higher synchronization pressure, but the Nova-Frame has already reached its strength limit! At least, with the current incomplete technology, it's impossible to meet your demands!"],["Dana","Is that Cicero? Who's he arguing with?"],["Grant","It's probably that agent that Natalia mentioned, the one with a bit of a... personality issue. Well, we'll find out soon enough."],["","Natalia didn't respond, she just maintained a faint smile and entered the command to open the security door. When they saw the scene inside the fourth hangar, Dana and Grant were taken aback."],["","The ground was littered with the wreckage of test STs, and without exception, the cuts were clean, as if they had been sliced into several pieces by some razor-sharp blade."],["","Standing in the middle of that pile of wreckage was a familiar-looking ST."],["Grant","Look at the Alter-Blade in that guy's hand. Most of the wreckage here is probably its handiwork... But this ST, why does it seem so familiar to me?"],["Dana","It looks almost identical to Kaidan's Möbius? No, that's not right. Although it appears to be the same type, the details don't match, and that paintwork—"],["Ophelia","Don't get it wrong, GKD Parcel Service. Its name is \"Ouroboros,\" not Möbius."],["","Noticing the arrival of Dana and the others, the ST casually cast aside its blade, still slick with oil from the combat test, and slowly walked over."],["","Cicero, who was frowning at the computer nearby, also looked up, showing a displeased expression to the group and loudly complaining, \"What took you so long?\""],["","Unlike the confused Grant, Dana immediately recognized the identity of the pilot. Paying no heed to Cicero, she instinctively drew her weapon, aiming at the approaching ST, Ouroboros."],["Dana","Ophelia? Why are you here!?"],["Natalia","No need to be nervous, she's not your enemy."],["","Natalia maintains her signature smile, gesturing for Dana to lower her weapon."],["Natalia","I understand there have been some unnecessary conflicts between you, but that was merely an accident caused by a lack of intelligence in the early stages of the operation."],["Natalia","In fact, when you were leaving the Fardan area, she even blocked the pursuing DLAF for you. Do you need more evidence...?"],["Grant","...The boss said this one doesn't play around."],["Dana","We don't want to turn our backs to a potential enemy on the battlefield... no matter what her position is within the GSA."],["Ophelia","I've no need for them either—they'll only get in my way. Natalia, call Michaela. Her support is enough."],["","Seeing that neither side had any intention of backing down, and with the tension only thickening, Natalia remains unfazed."],["Natalia","A few words may not be enough for you to see eye-to-eye... Fortunately, there's an urgent mission here that will allow you to get to know each other again before the official operation begins."],["","Natalia taps a few commands on her tactical tablet and hands it over, revealing a map of East Milkhama on the screen, with three bright dots moving rapidly northwest."],["Grant","ST signals? Who is this, and why are they moving toward the Central Mining Area?"],["Natalia","Just like the Luno Family you've seen, another of our partners infiltrated East Milkhama a few days ago and successfully uncovered a lot of important intelligence."],["Natalia","We were able to narrow down the six possible Legacy hiding locations thanks to their tracking investigation."],["Natalia","And now they are being targeted by the DL Agent forces. They're seeking our assistance."],["Natalia","Coincidentally, they're also folks you're quite familiar with."],["","The smile on Natalia's face seems to grow even wider, almost... mischievous."],["","Dana couldn't help but frown, a sense of foreboding rising within her."],["Dana","Who are they?"],["","Natalia gently taps the light spot on the tablet, and the information of three STs and their pilots immediately fills the screen."],["","As she declared, they are individuals very familiar to Dana and the others."],["Grant","...Electric Eel Mercenaries!?"],["","At the same time, Southern Central Mining Area, DL Operations Camp"],["Ma'at","Your Excellency, the Oversight Committee has made its preliminary decision: Rear Admiral Tiphys Mill is indeed being suspected of treason. He's to be escorted back from the frontlines for further interrogation."],["Ma'at","Vesper's train has also been secretly intercepted by our people, and the EMP bomb has been recovered. It will soon be distributed to various strongholds as planned."],["Lukmund","Great, next we just need to advance the front line as much as possible before the order from the local military headquarters comes..."],["Lukmund","If we can wrest control of the Central Mining Area from Vesper, we can deliver a critical blow to the defense forces—ugh! Damn it."],["Ma'at","Your Excellency, your wound...!"],["Lukmund","...It's nothing. A few days' rest is all it needs."],["Lukmund","Besides, to deal with those sharp old foxes, this level of injury actually works to my advantage..."],["","That being said, a hint of displeasure still showed on Lukmund's face as he endured the pain."],["Lukmund","I'm supposed to be taking care of this next operation personally. Looks like I'll be leaving it to you."],["Lukmund","Don't let me down, Ma'at."],["Ma'at","Understood, Your Excellency, I will not fail."]],"441501301":[["","Eastern Parill Desert Safe House"],["","Dana's team successfully evades their pursuers and, guided by Natalia, reaches a safe house."],["","After securing the area, the group gathered in the temporary operations room under Natalia's instructions. However, instead of exchanging information, they remained silent, keeping their distance and watching each other warily."],["","GKD Parcel Service, Ophelia, Electric Eel Mercenaries... It was a marriage of convenience, not a union born out of trust."],["Grant","So... who's gonna tell us what's going on?"],["Grant","Why did you go to the DL's territory?"],["","In the end, it was Grant who broke the silence, throwing his question to Frida."],["","Movme, who had been holding back for a long time, couldn't wait to take over the conversation and vent his grievances."],["Movme","It's that old woman, Rosemary Jean! She said that by completing some simple tasks, our criminal records would be wiped clean."],["Movme","But in reality? We got sent to infiltrate East Milkhama to investigate the private stronghold of the allied governor!"],["Natalia","I must remind you, Movme, that conversations in the safe house are fully recorded. Perhaps... you should choose your words carefully."],["Movme","What? I, uh..."],["","Movme's lips moved as if to launch into another complaint, but like a malfunctioning machine, no words came out. Fenrir smirked mockingly."],["","Frida shook her head helplessly and continued speaking on his behalf."],["Frida","We investigated 11 suspicious buildings and identified 5 of them as strongholds. However, during the 12th investigation, we were exposed and tracked by a DL agent."],["Fenrir","It's all Movme's fault! We finally sneaked into the stronghold and placed trackers on the trucks loaded with EMP weapons, but he activated the anti-theft alarm!"],["Movme","You, you still have the nerve to blame me? When the stronghold guards came to check, we were all hiding, but you just had to open fire—"],["Grant","Wait, what did you just say? You put a tracking device on something!?"],["Dana","Are you sure you've found the EMP bomb!?"],["","Seeing Dana and Grant suddenly get serious, Fenrir and Movme exchanged glances and stopped arguing."],["Frida","...That's right, when we infiltrated, the people at the base were loading some special devices into vehicles."],["Frida","Based on the intelligence previously shared by Natalia Coronado, it can be roughly determined that it is an EMP weapon designed by Vesper."],["Frida","Taking advantage of the guards' shift change, we installed trackers on the nearest trucks. So far they're still functioning normally."],["","Frida operated the tactical board in the operations room, synchronizing the ST data to everyone."],["","Multiple signatures can be seen scattered across East Milkhama. Strikingly, they almost completely overlap with the previously identified coordinates of Lukmund's private strongholds."],["Natalia","...This is very important intelligence. Well done, Electric Eel."],["Natalia","Based on these coordinates, there is a high possibility that the remaining pulse weapons and even the Legacy are placed in the other private strongholds."],["Natalia","We must launch simultaneous attacks as soon as possible before the trackers are discovered or Lukmund's forces relocate again."],["Natalia","If the Legacy is successfully found, prioritize getting it back safely."],["","Central Mining Area, Vesper Base"],["Lorenzo","Arthur, is everything going smoothly on your end?"],["Arthur","Hmm... We arrived at the artillery location five minutes ago, Apophis's..."],["","Arthur abruptly stopped speaking, biting her lip tightly, but said nothing more."],["","Lorenzo didn't urge or comfort her, just quietly waited for her to speak again."],["Arthur","...The remains of Apophis have been successfully recovered."],["Arthur","Now returning to the base."],["Lorenzo","...Thank you for your hard work, Arthur."],["","Arthur nodded and then closed the communication. She didn't want her comrades to see even a hint of weakness."],["Lorenzo","......"],["","Lorenzo couldn't help but let out a deep sigh."],["","As a former legendary mercenary who left footprints all over the world, he was no stranger to the passing of a friend."],["","Even so, a profound sense of helplessness still washed over him. He understood... now was not the time for sorrow and confusion."],["","The situation is critical, and he must hold Vesper together with the surviving compatriots."],["","Perhaps intentionally waiting until the communication ended, another voice sounded at just the right moment."],["Vesper Warrior","Lorenzo, he's here."],["Lorenzo","…Understood, take him to the temporary operations room, I'll be there shortly."],["","In desperate situations, when someone extends a helping hand, it doesn't always mean true safety; instead, it might lead to a deeper trap—a lesson he learned through his own experience."],["","With Cassha away on a special mission, the survival of Vesper must be shouldered by him."],["Lorenzo","Let me see what kind of scheme you're plotting, Yevgeny Goman."],["","East Milkhama City, Belsuth Eastern Suburbs"],["","Perhaps due to its distance from the Central Mining Area, this city lacks much of a warlike atmosphere."],["","Nevertheless, the DL Police nearby are quite busy at the moment, constantly receiving supplies withdrawn from the front lines and transporting them."],["DL Police","Captain, I gotta ask... These are army STs—why's it us who's gotta haul them?"],["DL Police","Specially retrieving these things from the battlefield... What secrets are inside?"],["Adrien","You know about the Bionic Intelligence Frame, right? It's said that these STs are equipped with the latest military model, and the higher-ups want the combat data inside."],["Adrien","The front line is in chaos now, and the Security Maintenance Force is busy, so this job falls on us."],["Adrien","Alright, let's get moving. Once we finish transporting these things, we can clock out."],["","Upon hearing this, the allied police stopped chatting, quickly checked the containers, and then started the vehicles, heading to the army's designated location."],["","Adrien operated with a lazy demeanor, yet his eyes constantly observed the others present. Seeing everyone had left, he quickly moved behind the container and tapped lightly in a unique rhythm."],["","After a brief wait, the container opened from the inside, and almost simultaneously, a handgun was pressed against Adrien's forehead."],["Kaidan","Long time no see, Officer Adrien. I didn't expect the contact Matilda mentioned to be you."],["","The missing fugitive was hiding in a military supplies container and even managed to escape to the central city of the DL—"],["","But Officer Adrien showed not the slightest hint of nerves—almost as if he had been expecting this all along."],["Adrien","I never expected that one day I'd be on a mission to help a fugitive."],["","Adrien quickly surveyed the surroundings again and nodded to Kaidan and Elise inside the container to indicate safety."],["","Kaidan also put away his pistol and walked out together with Elise."],["Elise","Is this... near Belsuth?"],["Adrien","That's right, Doctor, we are right at the border between Belsuth and Fardan."],["Adrien","This area is far from the front lines, and the DLAF hasn't set up many outposts. As long as you follow the route I provided, you can avoid most of the surveillance."],["","Adrien pointed to the already running truck, signaling Kaidan to use it for the transfer."],["Adrien","About fifteen kilometers to the east, you will see a base disguised as a hotel."],["Adrien","Officer Shawnee is waiting for you there."]],"441502101":[["","In a luxury suite on the top floor of a hotel in the eastern suburbs of Belsuth, Shawnee is sitting in a temporary office handling various affairs."],["","Although she is still technically on probation, most of the work continues to be handled by her as usual—a result of her political backers various machinations."],["","Knock, knock, knock—the sound of the door suddenly echoed across the room. Shawnee checked the time, then wrapped up her work and sat up straight."],["Shawnee","Come in."],["","As the door opened, two familiar faces appeared before her as planned."],["Shawnee","It's great to see you here, Kaidan, Elise."],["Elise","…Hmm, long time no see, Shawnee."],["Kaidan","I heard you were suspended and under house arrest. I thought I'd have to visit you in prison, but here you are in a luxury hotel."],["Shawnee","If Lukmund could really prove my \"Betrayal of the DL,\" then I would indeed be in a cell awaiting trial."],["Shawnee","It's thanks to your successful escape from the DLAF. If anyone falls into Lukmund's hands, regardless of the truth, it would become evidence against me."],["","Kaidan walked straight to the window and looked at the DL guards outside the hotel through the half-drawn curtains."],["Kaidan","Are you sure this place is absolutely safe?"],["Shawnee","The guards right now are on our side, and the surveillance lines have been preemptively handled. No one will know you were here... at least, it's safe enough for a short time."],["Kaidan","...As thorough as ever."],["","Reassured, Kaidan put his doubts aside and handed a small data card to Shawnee."],["Kaidan","It's from Matilda. According to her, it contains internal DLAF communications that Hardaway intercepted before, as well as some data related to the PAMS System."],["Shawnee","...Thank you. I also have some information I hope to convey to Major Matilda, but before that—"],["","Shawnee quickly put away the data card, then operated the computer a few times, projecting the image onto the wall."],["","It was a map of East Milkhama, which, after some panning and zooming, finally settled on a military base."],["Elise","Is this the Yalton Base?"],["Shawnee","That's right, the DLAF Yalton Base, commonly used by the 08 Mobile Squad under Rear Admiral Tiphys."],["Kaidan","These points and route plans... Is this some kind of pre-battle deployment? Is someone planning to attack this base head-on?"],["Shawnee","It's Lukmund."],["Shawnee","Due to his arrangements, the true identity of Vesper's leader has been leaked, leading to Rear Admiral Tiphys being taken into custody by the Oversight Committee."],["Shawnee","You should have already heard about this from Matilda."],["","Elise's eyes dimmed even further, and she lowered her head. Shawnee noticed, but with time running short, she had to press on."],["Shawnee","According to the orders of the Oceanic Conclave, all units closely associated with Rear Admiral Tiphys must be disarmed and subjected to investigation."],["Shawnee","The 08 Mobile Squad, being under the direct command of the Rear Admiral, does not believe the committee's accusations. They're refusing to disarm, maintaining a firm defense at the Yalton Base."],["Kaidan","...An admirable loyalty, but I'm afraid this is precisely what Lukmund wants."],["Shawnee","That's right, Lukmund's goal from the beginning was not just to bring down Rear Admiral Tiphys, but to weaken the DLAF and even intervene in their command system."],["Shawnee","So, wielding his wartime authority, he deliberately dispatched the Diracca forces to carry out the suppression, attempting to exploit the moment and drive wedges between the ranks of the DLAF."],["Kaidan","Diracca... I remember she is closely related to you, like Kelly. Lukmund's trick of using a borrowed knife to kill is truly vicious."],["Elise","...We can't let him succeed."],["","Elise suddenly lifts her head, her eyes unusually sharp, as if burning with some kind of flame."],["","It was something Shawnee and Kaidan had never seen in her before—a calm yet hate-filled gaze."],["Elise","We need to go help the 08 Mobile Squad to prevent their collapse—but also to stop them from getting into an irreconcilable feud with Diracca's forces."],["Shawnee","...I agree with your point, Doctor, but currently we have no troops to dispatch."],["Shawnee","Along with the Diracca forces, the Security Maintenance Force directly controlled by Lukmund has also been dispatched. Any team supporting the 08 Mobile Squad will be seen by the DL as an enemy."],["Kaidan","...Perhaps we don't need to engage the entire suppression force head-on."],["Kaidan","The 08 Mobile Squad is under Tiphys' direct command, and in terms of strength, it certainly won't lose to the mere Security Maintenance Force."],["Kaidan","If we can create an opportunity to break through, we should be able to resolve this crisis."],["","XC 119, March 5. Dawnstar League Armored Forces Yalton Base Outpost"],["Squad 08 Captain","I'll say it again, we do not accept the Oversight Committee's slander against Rear Admiral Tiphys."],["Squad 08 Captain","Until sufficient evidence is obtained by the military tribunal and a fair, open trial is held, we will not leave Yalton Base nor lay down our arms."],["Squad 08 Captain","As a fellow soldier, you must understand our anger."],["Diracca","...I understand, and I don't believe their accusations against Rear Admiral Tiphys either, but—"],["","Suddenly, alarms blare near the outpost, accompanied by bursts of gunfire and explosions."],["Security Maintenance Force","All units, follow orders to suppress the 08 Mobile Squad and seize the Yalton Base!"],["Diracca","Did the Security Maintenance Force actually choose to launch a surprise attack!?"],["","The squad members involved in the negotiations hurriedly depart and board the STs on standby."],["Squad 08 Captain","Unfortunately, the guy who gave you the orders doesn't care how we respond."],["","He cocked the pistol and aimed it at Diracca."],["Squad 08 Captain","Return to your unit and complete your mission, Diracca Davies."],["Squad 08 Captain","We're soldiers. We'll do what we have to do."],["Diracca","...Sorry."]],"441502301":[["","A certain indoor military training ground, Northern Belsuth, East Milkhama"],["Squad 08 Member","Captain, each squad has dispersed and infiltrated the designated areas. No signs of tracking have been detected for now."],["Squad 08 Captain","Very well. Tell them to stay alert. Leaving aside the DLAF, the Security Maintenance Force under Lukmund will definitely hunt us down with full force."],["","After the battle at the Yalton Base, Squad 08, along with Kaidan and Elise, quickly dispersed and relocated."],["","Although it's still not absolutely safe, it's enough to buy time for rest, recuperation, and digesting intelligence."],["Squad 08 Captain","Also, lift the resrtaint on Kaidan Newman; let him go to the operations room with Elise."],["Squad 08 Member","Captain, you've decided to trust him?"],["Squad 08 Captain","Communication records, ST recordings, and the encrypted credentials of Major Matilda and Chief Officer Shawnee... the current situation no longer permits further suspicion."],["Squad 08 Captain","It's time to tell them the latest intelligence on Rear Admiral Tiphys."],["","Kaidan and Elise walked into the operations room, where the Squad 08 members were already setting up a new mission."],["","Despite having been involved with the military for only a short time, Kaidan was all too familiar with the information displayed on the map."],["Kaidan","...A raid on a DL city?"],["Squad 08 Captain","According to the latest intelligence from the reconnaissance team, we have confirmed that Rear Admiral Tiphys is being held here."],["Elise","What, my father!?"],["Squad 08 Captain","Under the direction of Lukmund, the Oversight Committee bypassed the military. They're conducting a treason trial for the Rear Admiral at a secret base here."],["Squad 08 Captain","We don't believe this interrogation will yield a fair result... In fact, they have long determined that the Rear Admiral has been colluding with Lieutenant Phoenix."],["Kaidan","So you're planning to just go and snatch him?"],["","Even Kaidan couldn't help but show his surprise. If the previous battle could be considered a counterattack, what the 08 Mobile Squad is planning now amounts to a true act of rebellion."],["Squad 08 Captain","Just now, the Security Maintenance Force dispatched two ST squads towards the same location, each equipped with autonomous armaments."],["Squad 08 Captain","Their goal is to transfer the Rear Admiral to the headquarters of the Security Maintenance Force, placing him completely under the control of Lukmund's forces."],["","As he spoke, he turned his gaze toward Kaidan."],["Squad 08 Captain","Kaidan Newman, the data you brought is very important. It has allowed us to confirm that a significant portion of the Security Maintenance Force and the Oversight Committee has already fallen under the control of Lukmund's forces."],["Squad 08 Captain","It also allowed us to identify who the true enemy within the DL is... We cannot allow this scumbag's conspiracies to succeed time and time again."],["Elise","I'll go with you too!"],["","Elise hurriedly stepped forward, her eyes still flashing with that hateful light."],["Elise","Even if I can't fight directly, I'll do everything I can to help you! ST adjustments, intelligence sorting, electronic warfare... Anything to rescue my father!"],["Kaidan","Count me in too."],["Squad 08 Captain","...You should stay out of this."],["Kaidan","The DL's disputes may not be my business. But I won't allow Phoenix to be turned into a political prop after his death. And..."],["Kaidan","Like you, I also have many accounts to settle with Lukmund."],["","East Milkhama's top-secret council"],["","The Dawnstar League Oceanic Conclave is holding an emergency online meeting."],["Deputy Secretary McGonagall","How are your injuries, Councilor Lukmund?"],["Lukmund","Thank you for your concern, but they're just scratches."],["Lukmund","More importantly, have you all reviewed the investigation results related to Vesper that were previously submitted to the Conclave?"],["Supreme Councilor Lawrence","We've all seen it. Vesper's infiltration has indeed exceeded expectations."],["Supreme Councilor Lawrence","It's truly regrettable that we couldn't recover the Legacy. Fortunately, Vesper has suffered a major setback, and the situation is still under control."],["Supreme Councilor Aldia","However, the current state of the DLAF is equally concerning. As far as I know, about an hour ago, the 08 Mobile Squad directly under Tiphys Mill also launched a rebellion."],["Supreme Councilor Aldia","We believe that the military autonomy of the East Milkhama Defense Forces on the island should be temporarily revoked."],["Lukmund","...Then who should continue the task of rounding up Vesper and controlling the Central Mining Area?"],["Deputy Secretary McGonagall","We've made a preliminary decision on that."],["","That's it."],["","A nearly imperceptible sharp glint flashed in Lukmund's eyes; everything that has happened so far is just as he expected—"],["Deputy Secretary McGonagall","We hope to entrust the frontline command of the army to Major Matilda Rossi."],["Lukmund","What?"],["Supreme Councilor Lawrence","This is the result of a joint decision with DLAF Headquarters and has already received the support of the majority of the council members."],["Supreme Councilor Lawrence","If Councilor Lukmund has other ideas, we can discuss further."],["Lukmund","...No, Major Rossi has distinguished herself in battle, is highly capable, and has no emotional or financial ties with the Milkhamans. I believe she is very suitable."],["Lukmund","I'm just a bit concerned about whether she can truly represent the interests of the Oceanic Conclave."],["Supreme Councilor Aldia","Since you, Councilor Lukmund, are overseeing the overall situation, I believe the situation in Milkhama will not head in the wrong direction."],["Supreme Councilor Aldia","Moreover, this can also fundamentally prevent the Oceanic Conclave from directly interfering with the military, consolidating our supervisory position over the DLAF."],["Lukmund","...Understood, I will definitely bring a satisfactory answer to everyone."],["","The meeting then shifted to a new topic and reached a preliminary conclusion, continuing for another hour."],["Deputy Secretary McGonagall","That concludes the entirety of today's emergency meeting."],["Supreme Councilor Lawrence","Well, I have other matters to attend to, so I will take my leave. Councilor Lukmund, please take care of your health."],["","With that, the Supreme Council members left the call one by one, leaving only Lukmund."],["","He maintained a gentlemanly smile until the moment the communication was closed."],["Lukmund","Damn!"],["Lukmund","These old foxes, they still suspect me."],["","After rechecking that the line was secure, Lukmund dialed a secret number known only to himself."],["Lukmund","It's me. The data extraction of the Legacy must be accelerated."]],"441503101":[["","Bent, a small city in the central part of East Milkhama, Oversight Committee Executive Branch..."],["","The secret interrogation of Tiphys Mill has been ongoing for two days."],["DL Agent","I'll ask again, Rear Admiral Mill, when did you start assisting Vesper?"],["DL Agent","Sabotaging the institute, assassinating political figures, raiding Fardan, seizing the Legacy, occupying the Central Mining Area... Just how deeply involved were you in Phoenix Mill's operations?"],["","The committee interrogator towers over Tiphys, who sits rigidly in his chair."],["","Facing a general of such renown, he doesn't dare overstep—nor can he resort to his favorite methods of persuasion—but confidence still flickers in his eyes."],["","Having suffered the pain of losing a child, bearing the disgrace of being labeled a traitor, and undergoing two days of interrogation without rest—even the \"Hero of Milthus\" has limits."],["","The interrogator's task is simple: keep the pressure high and the air heavy, until the cracks begin to show."],["Tiphys","My answer will not change."],["Tiphys","My unit and I have never acted against the DL, and beyond open hostilities we have no other ties to Vesper."],["Tiphys","...We had no prior knowledge of Phoenix's operations, and we offered no aid of any kind."],["","Tiphys's face shows signs of fatigue, yet his gaze remains as sharp and steady as ever."],["","This displeases the interrogator, though he's just drawn a fresh card to play."],["DL Agent","\"Never acted against the DL\"? Is that right?"],["DL Agent","Moments ago we received an official notice—Squad 08 refused to disarm, traded heavy fire with friendlies, then broke away from the Yalton base."],["DL Agent","Evidence further indicates Kaidan Newman and Elise Mill are moving with them."],["Tiphys","...Excuse me?"],["","The interrogator flips his tablet around, letting Tiphys see the combat feed and the Security Maintenance Force's urgent dispatch."],["DL Agent","Squad 08 is directly under your command, General. Dr. Elise is your daughter, and Kaidan Newman is a potential spy who has repeatedly obstructed DL operations."],["DL Agent","Even so, you still mean to claim you have nothing to do with this rebellion?"],["Tiphys","......"],["","Seeing Tiphys fall into a brief silence, the interrogator can almost taste victory."],["","Knock, knock... At that moment, someone knocks at the interrogation room door."],["Security Maintenance Force","Time's up. We need to move."],["DL Agent","Now? No. Give me twenty minutes."],["Security Maintenance Force","No can do. Direct order from Governor Lukmund."],["DL Agent","...Tch, understood."],["","The interrogator pulls in a deep breath and swallows the irritation clawing up his throat."],["DL Agent","It's a pity we couldn't settle this today, General."],["DL Agent","But don't worry—once you're at security HQ, we'll have all the time we need to reach a real consensus."]],"441503301":[["","With Cassha leading the way, they charge at full speed and arrive at the secret Vesper base beneath the old factory."],["","Although several STs lagging behind are caught in the blast, large-scale destruction is ultimately avoided."],["Elise","The electromagnetic storm outside is causing complete chaos. We can't assess citywide damage just yet."],["Elise","However, based on the activation distance, I'm afraid... it's not looking good."],["Kaidan","...Answer me, Cassha, is this part of Vesper's operation?"],["Cassha","No. That blast wasn't ours."],["","Cassha exits the cockpit, grabs the hoist rope, and quickly descends to the ground. She approaches the group and responds to Kaidan's hostile inquiry."],["","The Squad 08 members also raise their weapons and aim at her."],["Squad 08 Member","Don't come any closer, Vesper!"],["","Vesper's fighters don't flinch. They bring their guns up on Squad 08 in kind."],["Tiphys","Weapons down, Squad 08."],["Squad 08 Member","...Yes, General."],["Cassha","You too—guns down. No need to overreact."],["","Upon hearing this, Squad 08 and the Vesper members gradually put down their weapons, and Cassha walks up to Kaidan and the others."],["Kaidan","According to Elise's analysis, that EMP was the same model you fielded before."],["Cassha","...That was indeed a weapon we designed using the power of the Legacy, but it's no longer under our control."],["Cassha","The key—the Legacy—isn't in our hands anymore. Operation Dusk has been skewed into something completely different."],["","Operation Dusk—Kaidan's mind flashes back to Phoenix's plan during their last standoff."],["","Move pulse weapons by rail into a major DL city, then trigger them to gut the government and military's infosphere in one shot."],["","If the Legacy is the key, there's only one man left who can turn it now—"],["Kaidan","...Are you saying it was... Lukmund!?"],["Elise","...The governor launched an attack on a DL city? But why?"],["Emergency Broadcast","— Bent City and its surrounding areas have suffered severe damage, with preliminary reports indicating over 300,000 people have been affected, including several officials caught in the chaos..."],["","The Vesper machinist, who has been tirelessly working to establish communications, finally succeeds in connecting to the communication cable buried at the stronghold, and receives an emergency broadcast from the outside world."],["Emergency Broadcast","Existing evidence suggests that this is a terrorist attack initiated by the DL rebels led by Tiphys Mill, in conjunction with Vesper..."],["Tiphys","...So that's their play."],["Squad 08 Captain","They're actually pinning everything on us!?"],["","The broadcast causes a huge uproar within the stronghold. The entirety of Squad 08 seethes with rage, while the Vesper fighters scowl upon hearing it."],["","Even Elise cannot help but clench her fists."],["Elise","Eliminate dissidents, divide the army, consolidate power... Lukmund will stop at nothing to get what he wants."],["Cassha","He's Vesper's number one enemy, and Milkhama's, too... maybe all of ours."],["","Cassha's gaze passes over Kaidan, Elise, Squad 08—then settled on Tiphys."],["Cassha","General Tiphys, Dr. Elise."],["Cassha","If you've no clear road ahead, come back to the Central Mining Area with me."],["","The air seems to suddenly freeze, and for a moment, the entire outpost is filled only with the intermittent sound of the broadcast."],["Cassha","Even if it's just to see Phoenix one last time. I think... he would like that."],["Hardaway","But in the end, General Tiphys turned down Cassha Lumiere's invitation."],["Kaidan","Being former enemies, Squad 08 can't afford to trust Vesper."],["Kaidan","Moreover, Lukmund still has at least four sets of EMP bombs, and no one knows when or where he'll activate them again."],["Kaidan","General Tiphys hopes to quickly locate and destroy these weapons to prevent another disaster in Bent City."],["","Only in this way can they face the reality of what has occurred—and face Phoenix."],["Hardaway","I see... Then our timing is perfect."],["Kaidan","Meaning?"],["Hardaway","The Oceanic Conclave has just issued a formal order to transfer frontline command to Matilda, with the authority to call upon a portion of the Security Maintenance Force as needed."],["Hardaway","The handover was rushed—the Security Maintenance Force didn't have time to fully scrub tasking or comm logs."],["Hardaway","I found several black facilities with murky ownership... and one sits right outside Bent."],["Kaidan","You think those sites are the pulse weapon caches?"],["Hardaway","It's possible. I had planned to investigate personally after completing my current tasks, but now it seems it might be too late."],["Hardaway","Pushing the coordinates to you now. If you're dry on leads, start there."],["","East Milkhama City, an old factory in Thepia's eastern suburbs..."],["Ophelia","...One went active?"],["Natalia","Details are fuzzy, but the area around Bent took a heavy EMP hit—that much tracks."],["Natalia","The DL government is calling it a terrorist attack launched by rebels in collusion with Vesper."],["Grant","What a crock! It went off in Lukmund's private depot and he gets to walk away scot-free?!"],["Dana","This proves that Lukmund's control over East Milkhama has exceeded our imagination."],["Natalia","Because of this incident, your recon of the Bent outpost is moot."],["Natalia","You need to find a way to push southeast—close in on Fardan."],["Dana","Fardan again... What about the others?"],["Natalia","Epiphyllum and Erisa's squad are moving—reconning targets near Kelvin and Ferron as planned."],["Natalia","Marcus's Ashes just shook off DL agents and reached the outskirts of Fiali."],["Natalia","As for the Luno family, initial infiltration of Belsuth is complete, but the target building isn't fully pinned."],["Grant","Then we need to move fast."],["Natalia","Expect DL deployments to shift. Be careful out there."]],"441504101":[["","Northwest of Fardan, a small dilapidated town..."],["","This place was originally intended for the development of a resort, but for various reasons, construction stalled. All that remains is a wasteland strewn with relics of the failed project."],["","After several transfers, it was finally acquired at a very low price by a company under Lukmund's control and converted into a warehouse for cargo distribution."],["","Normally you'd see only guards and workers here. But not this week."],["Lukmund's Private Guard","Third squad reporting—taking your shift."],["Lukmund's Private Guard","Wait for the fourth squad from the south to return, then you can all rack out together."],["","Under the lights and in the shadows, fully armed soldiers can be seen everywhere—even heavy weapons platforms and STs."],["","For a warehouse town, the kind of defense footprint is absurd. What's even more absurd is that both the defense forces and the police seem to be unaware of it."],["Lukmund's Private Guard","E-weapon rig is complete. Once Officer Ma'at gives the go code, we can proceed with the transfer."],["","Alarms suddenly rip the town wide open."],["Lukmund's Private Guard","What's going on?"],["Scout","Squad Four requesting reinforcements! We've engaged roaming Squad 08!"],["Scout","Lead hostile ST identified as a custom Euclase—it's likely Rear Admiral Tiphys Mill!"],["Lukmund's Private Guard","Mill!? We're heading over immediately! You other two squads—stay here to protect the E-weapon!"],["","The standby STs quickly form teams and head south. Soon, less than half of the town's defense forces remain."],["","Nearby, two shadows are watching the events unfold."],["Elise","Father's bait is working like a charm."],["Kaidan","We're up."],["","He signals to several Squad 08 members also infiltrating the area, assigning each their targets."],["Kaidan","We make our move in sixty seconds."]],"441504301":[["","South Fardan, the Lowest Level of the DLAF Research Institute's Central Lab..."],["Dr. Newman","Our location has been discovered."],["Lukmund","What's going on?"],["Dr. Newman","E-weapon No. 4 was triggered prematurely. Someone tracked our position using the verification code."],["Dr. Newman","Pulling that off in such a tight window means they know me very well."],["Lukmund","...It has to be her—Elise Mill."],["","Lukmund makes no effort to hide the coldness and disdain in his words, even though Elise was a top scientist he personally trained."],["","The Legacy has just completed the extraction of important data and requires use of the computer array in the institute to complete the most critical step of the plan..."],["Lukmund","How is the rewriting of the consensus mechanism going?"],["Dr. Newman","To control East Milkhama's entire network, we first have to seize a majority of the core AIs."],["Dr. Newman","The central AIs of Fardan and Belsuth have been completely rewritten, and the security mechanisms of Thepia are currently being cracked in a distributed manner."],["","According to previous intelligence from Bent City, Elise, Kaidan, and Tiphys's forces are acting together, and they are likely already heading this way."],["Lukmund","The risk of continuing to invest all computing power is too great."],["Lukmund","Abort the current rewriting operation and prepare for combat and relocation."],["Lukmund","...If they are coming, let's arrange the grandest welcoming party we can muster."],["","At the same time, at a roadside rest stop northwest of Fardan City..."],["Paloma","Do you have... yogurt?"],["","The barman shot her a weary, irritated look. With a flick of his hand he slid a glass of ice water to her over the counter."],["","Paloma doesn't mind at all. She casually finds a spot to sit down, completely ignoring the stains on the table and chairs that smudge her gaudy clothes."],["","Suddenly, a flashing green dot appears in the upper right corner of her vision—a sign of special contact received by her cybernetic eye, visible only to her."],["","She doesn't need to see the name to know who it is—after all, there are only a few people on all Milkhama who can contact her, especially at a time like this."],["Paloma","Off-hours call? That's rare, Captain Ada."],["Ada","I told you—no action without orders."],["Paloma","Sorry, sorry. But you know our squad's rules, as long as we get results, any mistake can be written off—"],["Paloma","And judging by the results, perhaps you shouldn't be reprimanding me. You might even want to thank me..."],["Ada","...Fine. Then impress me—what did you get?"],["","Getting the drop on the \"unbeatable\" captain puts Paloma in a good mood."],["","With a mischievous smile, she transmits the intercepted data."],["Paloma","I've found that Legacy you've been after."]],"441505101":[["","After completing the operation, Kaidan and the others reunite with Tiphys's forces at the pre-designated safe point."],["","Thanks to the teamwork of Elise and the Squad 08 machinist, the activation sequence of the EMP bomb that had stopped midway was completely rolled back, and the device itself was re-encased with electromagnetic shielding."],["","This way, it can at least be moved with peace of mind—without the worry of it being suddenly activated by some external code."],["","Meanwhile, Kaidan and Tiphys take this time to exchange information."],["Kaidan","Reversion Squad? So that's who she was?"],["Tiphys","As far as I know, \"Paloma\" isn't her real name—it's a callsign in an independent unit called Reversion."],["Kaidan","Like the Antibody Squad we encountered underground in Fardan?"],["Tiphys","Close, but not the same."],["Tiphys","Antibody are picked from the Defense Forces, but they're not military—they report straight to the Oceanic Conclave. Think of them as the council's private soldiers."],["Tiphys","Reversion aren't limited to soldiers—they're drawn from every sector of the DL. They possess a rare degree of operational autonomy, and can't be dispatched unilaterally by any office—not even the Conclave itself."],["Kaidan","Explains why she didn't act like a soldier—and why she didn't care what the pulse weapon did to the neighborhood."],["Tiphys","They usually don't fight frontline. If I'm right, that battle was in fact Paloma freelancing."],["Kaidan","Just to put Elise in her place?"],["","Even though Paloma's behavior seemed reckless and unrestrained, Kaidan still doesn't believe the answer is that simple."],["Tiphys","The existence of the Reversion Squad itself is a DL secret, and with personnel changes occurring frequently, I have no way of knowing their current size and purpose."],["","Tiphys shakes his head. At this stage they don't have enough intelligence, nor do they have the capacity to focus entirely on Paloma."],["Squad 08 Member","Rear Admiral, we've arrived at the southern area of Fardan."],["","The moment Tiphys learns that Elise has captured the Legacy signal, he dispatches scouts to approach Fardan and map an infiltration route."],["","To break into the research institute, they must first deal with the adjacent military base and at least find a way to block reinforcements."],["Squad 08 Member","The base interior is currently deployed with two squad-size ST units and three automatic gunports. We don't know if there are any other defenses."],["Kaidan","...That's lighter than I expected."],["Tiphys","The southern city research institute was severely damaged by Vesper's attack, and various system functions have not fully recovered. Important data and equipment have also been transferred—at least, that's the official line."],["Tiphys","On paper, the Legacy is not in Lukmund's hands, and he lacks a suitable reason to directly deploy the army for defense... However, this does not mean that Lukmund has no other preparations in store."],["","Tiphys's expression is serious. Even if the city defense forces are not a significant threat, they cannot underestimate the private armed forces Lukmund may have."],["","To make headway through all the lines set by Lukmund before the Legacy is transferred, their actions must be swift and decisive."],["Kaidan","In that case, I've got a plan. Interested, Rear Admiral?"]],"441505301":[["","Inside the central laboratory, Lukmund frowns, his expression grim. The screen in front of him displays the security status of the base and the research institute."],["","It is clear that Kaidan and his group have already made headway through the base defenses and are moving deeper into the research facility."],["Lukmund","New weapons, three squadrons, and they still couldn't stop them. Truly a bunch of incompetents."],["Lukmund","What about the UNCS Hyper-Aptamer?"],["Researcher","She has been tracking the Legacy's signal all this way and fallen into our trap, but relying solely on the facility's auto-defenses won't hold her long."],["Researcher","If they link with GKD and break through, the worst-case scenario is that they arrive at the central laboratory in ten minutes."],["","As soon as the researcher finishes speaking, Lukmund receives an emergency communication on a channel known only to a few trusted confidants."],["Ma'at","Your Excellency, agents of the Oversight Committee are approaching the institute. You should pull out now."],["Lukmund","What's going on?"],["Ma'at","Shawnee Russell has somehow obtained some data unfavorable to you and handed it over to the committee."],["Ma'at","Although our partners responded promptly, some data couldn't be scrubbed in time, which aroused suspicion among the upper echelons."],["Lukmund","So they're sending eyes to test the story, are they?"],["Lukmund","They must have reached some sort of understanding with the Oceanic Conclave and are using this opportunity to test my response."],["Lukmund","...Prioritize deleting the rewrite records of the consensus mechanism and destroy the related equipment. Leave no trace."],["Lukmund","Other experiment data related to the Legacy should be modified according to the preset plan. Anything risky should also be directly destroyed."],["Researcher","Understood. Starting now."],["Ma'at","Sir, do you need me to call for reinforcements?"],["Lukmund","No need, you continue handling the affairs of the Central Mining Area and don't ease off Gabriel."],["Lukmund","Also, I need you to monitor Victoria's actions to confirm if she has any additional connections with the homeland."],["Lukmund","As for the Tiphys rebels and the UNCS spies... let them be reduced to ashes along with this research institute."],["","Sankara Convention Center, Private Lounge"],["","The UNCS and Freed Milkhama have just concluded their first meeting, lasting for three hours."],["","Gabriel drags his weary body back to his quarters. After dismissing the guard, he eagerly opens the comms line."],["Ma'at","...What can I do for you, Commander Gabriel?"],["","Although the language is polite, the attitude is somewhat indifferent—clearly, Ma'at is busy with her current task, and now might not be the best time to contact her."],["","But Gabriel couldn't care less."],["Gabriel","My family should have arrived on the mainland by now—what's their status?!"],["Ma'at","Our people are currently escorting them to the residence you specified. They will contact you actively upon arrival. If you're worried, you can call them yourself."],["","Gabriel breathes a sigh of relief—but the feeling quickly fades, replaced by a returning anxiety."],["Gabriel","...and also, is Phoenix really—"],["Ma'at","At this point, does that still matter to you?"],["","Ma'at's tone turns cold, tinged with derision."],["Ma'at","Vesper will soon be completely destroyed. Even with Yevgeny Goman's interference, the outcome will remain the same."],["Ma'at","You just need to follow our previous agreement and keep the UNCS tied up here with empty talks."],["Ma'at","Additionally, we have replaced some of the security personnel at the venue. If you see new faces, don't be alarmed."],["Gabriel","What are you planning!?"],["Ma'at","No need to be so tense, Gabriel."],["Ma'at","We've learned some \"Milkhaman extremists\" plan to storm the meeting and stage a protest."],["Ma'at","Our adjustments are precautionary, nothing more."],["","As for what kind of \"precaution,\" Ma'at doesn't seem inclined to explain."],["","Meanwhile, in a hidden storage room at the Sankara Convention Center..."],["Ma'at","Our adjustments are precautionary, nothing more."],["","The conversation between Ma'at and Gabriel is transmitted word for word into the listener's ear."],["UNCS Agent","Bro, do you think they'll target [Madam]?"],["Anderson","Given the current situation, we cannot rule out that possibility."],["Anderson","Compare the changes in the conference attendees to identify every potential DL agent and these so-called \"Milkhaman extremists.\""],["Anderson","Sync everything to Major Shin Sagara. Being the personal guard, he's the only one who can act in time."],["","While speaking, Anderson puts on a complete disguise once more, transforming in just a few minutes to the point where he is completely unrecognizable."],["Anderson","Have all teams prepare."],["Anderson","Next, it's time for our \"academic exchange\" with our foreign counterparts."]],"441506101":[["","Fardan South Research Institute, Third Experimental Zone"],["","Thanks to Ophelia's initial assault and the rear guard of Squad 08, Kaidan and his team meet little resistance and drive their STs hard through the institute."],["","However, after entering the Third Experimental Zone, the situation changes."],["Dana","Heads up—heavy Puppet signatures ahead!"],["","Oddly, the Puppets ignore them and pour fire into the zone's electronics instead."],["Kaidan","It must be Lukmund trying to destroy the evidence. Take them down!"],["","GKD and Tiphys split up and engage without hesitation."],["","In barely a minute, the Puppets are completely destroyed. After confirming the coast is clear, Elise steps forward to connect to the undamaged experimental equipment."],["Elise","No good. The hardware is fine, but the system logs were tampered with three minutes ago."],["Elise","The experiment records were wiped, and the backup space was filled with junk data..."],["","Elise tries various methods to extract valid data, but ultimately ends up with a nothing but a hopelessly corrupted feasibility assessment file."],["Elise","An overwrite simulation of the consensus mechanism? Why conduct such research...?"],["","At that moment, a violent explosion accompanied by a shockwave erupts from nearby. Tiphys quickly raises his shield to protect Elise near the exit."],["Tiphys","Stay safe, Elise. This is a battlefield."],["Grant","Sounds like the party's already started..."],["Kaidan","It's probably Ophelia... Everyone stay alert, let's go check it out together!"],["","Everyone instinctively shields Elise, cautiously moving forward."],["","At the back of the group, Elise seems unfazed by the blast, the ruined file gnawing at her thoughts."],["Elise","Consensus mechanism... Central AI... Could it be that Lukmund's goal is..."],["","At the same time, an unbalanced battle is taking place in the Fifth Experiment Zone..."],["","...an imbalance caused not by unequal numbers, but by vastly disproportionate combat power."],["Laboratory Guard","Stop her! The target's solo, don't be afraid—what!?"],["","Before he can finish his thought, an ally's shell experiences some strange kind of ‌redirection upon contact with the enemy ST, precisely hitting the defense unit coming in to assist."],["","Before he can react, a flash of blades sweeps by, severing his weapon arm. The cockpit is instantly filled with the red glow of alarms."],["Laboratory Guard","She... She's a m-monster...!"],["","In the footage returned by the optical monitor, the new UNCS ST, somewhat resembling Ursprung, moves like a wraith through the storm, with barely a scratch on it."],["","It reminds him of the legend of the Defense Force's \"super pilot.\""],["Lukmund's Private Guard","Fall back, fall back quickly! Don't let her get close to you!!!"],["Lukmund's Private Guard","Artillery—prep a full volley! Level the zone if you must—stop her!"],["Lukmund","Fifth Experimental Zone team, cease fire."],["Lukmund's Private Guard","Commander Lukmund!?"],["","Lukmund ignores his subordinates' astonishment and initiates open communication with the enemy ST at the center of the battlefield."],["Lukmund","...Ophelia, is it?"],["","Ophelia ignores him and continues to pilot the Ouroboros through the ring, reaping machines like wheat."],["","With his cease-fire in force, the guards dare not shoot—only block and dodge."],["Lukmund","Deprived of freedom and human rights, reduced to mere guinea pigs for cruel experiments, enduring immense physical and mental suffering... Everything you Hyper-Aptamers have gone through is a sin—committed by the UNCS."],["Lukmund","Even with Blair's downfall, the UNCS still sees you as tools, forcing you to carry out dangerous, clandestine missions. I believe you must have realized their true nature by now."],["Lukmund","Whether it's the Legacy or the Central Mining Area, they are merely assets to the UNCS. They mean nothing to you. There is no need to die for them."],["Lukmund","Come over to my side. I'll give you the chance to take your revenge."],["Ophelia","Heh, revenge?"],["","She splits a fleeing guard ST at the spine before finally answering him."],["","But contrary to Lukmund's expectations, all he receives is pure scorn soaked in hate."],["Ophelia","You got one thing wrong. I do want revenge. But not just on the UNCS—you're on my list too, Lukmund Erambard."],["Lukmund","...What?"],["Ophelia","Eight years ago, DL agents were supposed to hit Blair's safe house and rescue the hostages."],["Ophelia","But they suddenly abandoned the mission and instead assisted Cicero and Ada Diaz in escaping... You gave that order. Don't tell me you forgot."],["Lukmund","...Eight years ago? Could it be—"],["Lukmund","Hahaha, so that's how it is, \"Ophelia\"... That's why you chose such a name!"],["Lukmund","No wonder you hate me! No wonder you hate Kaidan and Dr. Newman!"],["Ophelia","I'll break every bone in your body and let you die in fear and pain. You won't escape."],["Lukmund","Then I retract my offer. You're not just a UNCS tool—you're a stupid, rabid dog."],["Lukmund","You seek revenge? Come! This lab will be your grave!"]],"441506301":[["","Coming to his senses, Kaidan finds himself in an unfamiliar space."],["Kaidan","Is this the ocean?"],["","But unlike the ocean in his memory, the waves shimmer with starlight as they lap at his legs, feeling like a gentle breeze with little sensation and leaving no trace of moisture."],["","He tries to reach out, intending to touch the rocks by the sea—"],["Dr. Newman","You'd best not touch them."],["Kaidan","Father!? No... the Legacy? What is this place?"],["Dr. Newman","This isn't the world you know. It's an ocean of thought—made of arashi particles."],["Dr. Newman","The resonance of two Nova-Frames has caused the arashi particles inside the central computer to reach unprecedented activity levels, temporarily entangling our brainwaves."],["Dr. Newman","That's why we're able to meet again like this."],["Kaidan","...You seem... back to your old self?"],["","A faint, gentle smile graces Dr. Newman's face—an expression very familiar to Kaidan."],["Dr. Newman","I'm surprised too, son. It seems Lukmund's command couldn't reach this deep into the mind."],["Dr. Newman","The Legacy's shell might be under control, but Walter Newman's mind is still his own."],["","In that moment, long-gone memories vividly surge toward Kaidan, with the figures within gradually overlapping with the person before him."],["","But these feelings belong to a different Kaidan, one from long ago. He calmly walks to stand beside his father."],["Kaidan","How do I leave this place?"],["Dr. Newman","Do nothing."],["Dr. Newman","The Arashi field won't hold for long—once the Nova-Frames and the mainframe shut down, this place will fade."],["","*bang, bang, bang...* A sudden burst of gunfire erupts."],["","Several bullets fly straight toward Kaidan and Dr. Newman from behind, but only cause a ripple on their bodies, leaving no damage."],["","Hmph, no effect?"],["","...So you're here too, Ophelia."],["","Turning around, Ophelia emerges from behind a reef not far away."],["","Kaidan is not surprised by her appearance. In a world created by the resonance of the Nova-Frames with arashi particles, it makes sense she'd be here too."],["","Realizing gunfire means nothing here, she lets the gun drop, boots whispering against the particle surf as she walks closer."],["","Due to the obstruction of her eyepiece, Kaidan cannot see her expression, yet he still feels the undisguised hatred emanating from her."],["","Ophelia walks closer, and her swaying earrings catch Dr. Newman's attention."],["Dr. Newman","I remember those earrings."],["Dr. Newman","Ophelia... Is that your name?"],["","Dr. Newman suddenly becomes somewhat uneasy, staring intently at Ophelia, his expression oscillating between confusion and sadness."],["Dr. Newman","No... that's not your name. Your name is... is—"],["Ophelia","You don't remember, or you're afraid to remember?"],["","Ophelia removes her goggles, exposing her face to the two of them."],["","Face to face at close range, Kaidan suddenly feels that her appearance seems somewhat similar to the girl he dreamt of a few days ago."],["Ophelia","In your eyes, my mother and I should have died long ago, right?"],["Dr. Newman","...Aynis?"],["","Dr. Newman's tone is filled with surprise, shock, confusion, and regret."],["Kaidan","What?!"],["","Kaidan knows that name—from the old case files tied to his father's death. The girl who was supposed to have died seven years ago."],["Ophelia","It's been a long time, Father."],["Ophelia","You abandoned your wife and daughter, and now you're nothing but a brain in a jar. Fitting end."],["","Ophelia... no, Aynis Newman's face shows no joy in this reunion. Only hatred. Only scorn."],["","Meanwhile, the particle waves suddenly begin to rapidly recede, and the nearby reefs start to gradually disappear bit by bit. This space can no longer be maintained."],["Dr. Newman","I never abandoned you! I tried everything I could to protect all of you, but—"],["Ophelia","But you failed. Your plan protected Kaidan's secret and saved Ada Diaz, but sacrificed me and caused Mother's death!"],["Dr. Newman","..."],["","The figures of the three become transparent, and the surrounding space peels away like a broken puzzle."],["Kaidan","Even so, you're looking at the wrong man to hate."],["Ophelia","Shut up! You've no idea how lucky you are—what right do you have to lecture me?!"],["","Ophelia draws the blade from her waist and aims it at the two of them, declaring her complete rejection."],["Ophelia","I will have my revenge on all of you in my own way."],["","She takes a step back and walks straight into the collapsing space."],["Kaidan","Wait!"],["","Kaidan's outstretched hand touches nothing. In the gradually deepening darkness, only he and Dr. Newman remain."],["","In the central Laboratory, Dana and others surround the two crashed STs, anxiously waiting for them to awaken."],["Grant","Doctor, when will they wake up!?"],["","Elise simultaneously monitors the two STs and the central computer, tensely capturing every signal."],["Elise","A large amount of data from the Legacy is flowing into Ophelia's ST... What is this!?"],["","At this moment, Ophelia's Ouroboros suddenly restarts."],["Dana","Ophelia, are you awake?"],["Ophelia","......"],["","Ophelia ignores Dana and takes advantage of the last window before the resonance ends to transfer some data from the Legacy into her ST system."],["Ophelia","As suspected—the Nova-Frame is deliberately capped. Once I remove the limiter, I'll become a truly perfect Hyper-Aptamer."],["","With the data in hand, she swings her weapon toward the central computer—to destroy the Legacy."],["","Dana and the others don't even get a word out before Ouroboros's blade comes down."],["","This won't cut it."],["","A shadow streaks in at an almost imperceptible speed, striking Ouroboros's arm a heartbeat before impact, throwing the blow off course."],["Ophelia","What...?"],["","It is a DLAF standard small shield, and behind it, a special ST screams forward."],["","Seeing this, Ophelia twists Ouroboros and actively closes the distance, launching an attack before her opponent."],["","However, her opponent seems to anticipate this move. Just as the two machines are about to intersect, it suddenly reduces its speed and angles away."],["","Seeming off-balance, it uses the spin of its trajectory to launch a brutal kick. Ophelia crosses her blade to block, but the shock shoves her back meters."],["","Its agility breaks every rule of a regular ST—impossible fluidity, G-forces no pilot should survive."],["Tiphys","That ST, that movement, could it be...?!"],["Ada","Long time no see, Rear Admiral Tiphys."],["Dana","...Ada Diaz?!"],["Grant","Ada? Rosa's sister, the DL's super pilot? How did she end up here!?"],["","Ada's ST swiftly and steadily approaches the central computer. Dana and the others hesitate for a moment but decide to intervene. However—"],["Grant","The hell's happening? My ST won't move!?"],["Elise","Did she interfere with our arashium alloy? And without any special gear—how the heck is that even possible!?"],["Ada","Don't panic. I'm only here to borrow Dr. Newman's Legacy. As long as you don't get in my way, I won't become your enemy."],["","Every ST in the vicinity has lost the ability to move—except for Ophelia's Ouroboros."],["Ophelia","Don't think... that only you and the Valkyrie are special!"],["","Ophelia readies another strike, then suddenly receives an emergency message."],["Cicero","Stop, Ophelia!"],["Ophelia","Cicero?"],["Cicero","You can't handle her now. Pull back!"],["Cicero","I've finally obtained Newman's secret data. I can't leave it sitting in a place like that!"],["Ophelia","How do you know? Are you monitoring my ST?"],["Cicero","I... uh, it's all for your own good! Anyway, hurry to the place I specified! I'll help you improve the Nova-Frame and enhance your Hyper-Aptamer abilities!"],["Cicero","The time for revenge will surely come—bide your time!"],["Ophelia","...Tsk."],["","Although Ophelia hesitates, the scuffle moments ago proved that she is indeed at a disadvantage, plus her Ouroboros took damage during the exchange."],["","Bottling anger and shame, she stows her blade and turns away."],["","Ada no longer pays her any mind. She approaches the central computer, uses her own authority to lift the seal, and pulls the Legacy free."],["Ada","Now Rosa won't have to suffer anymore..."],["","A soft whisper, then her confident, sunny mask returns."],["Ada","Mission done. I'm leaving."],["Ada","By the way, if you're heading out, loop south—the Oversight Committee hasn't sealed that exit yet."],["","Seemingly uninterested in further interaction with those present, Ada directs her ST toward the exit, only to be stopped by the now-awake Kaidan calling after her."],["Kaidan","Wait, Ada! What are you going to do with the Legacy!?"],["Ada","...Kaidan Newman, I assure you I won't use your father's Legacy for anything unnecessary."],["Ada","My only aim is saving my sister."],["Kaidan","Sister... Rosa!? How is she now?"],["Ada","She's much better, but it no longer concerns you."],["Ada","She isn't the Valkyrie anymore. She shouldn't be dragged into any faction's open wars or shadow games."],["Ada","Especially you, GKD—you're the spark for Milkhama's next war."],["Kaidan","...What did you say?"],["Ada","If we meet on the battlefield, I won't hold back."],["","With that, Ada's ST punches out of the central lab and drops off every sensor like it was never there."]],"441551101":[["","In the southern woods of the institute, several STs crouch low, buried in the trees..."],["","DL drones drift overhead, multiband scans sweeping their position. They circle a few minutes, finding nothing before drifting away unsatisfied."],["Grant","Hey, it's just like Elise said, these recon drones really can't find us!"],["Kaidan","But we can't stay here for too long, the Oversight Committee will sniff out our jamming sooner or later."],["","About ten minutes ago, they received an emergency transmission from Squad 08, informing them that DL Oversight Committee forces are setting up a perimeter around the research facility."],["","Fortunately, as Ada Diaz reminded them before leaving, the agents hadn't had time to seal the emergency exit in the south of the research facility, allowing them to escape smoothly."],["Dana","But where should we go next?"],["Dana","Ada took the Legacy, and Ophelia is missing... With the Oversight Committee now involved, continuing to pursue Lukmund would be walking into a trap."],["Kaidan","Let's contact Natalia first. We need to regroup with the others."],["Kaidan","And inform Shawnee and Matilda of everything that went down here—they need to prep for the fallout."],["","As he says this, Kaidan turns his gaze toward Tiphys and the others, who seem to have just concluded a brief discussion."],["Kaidan","What are your plans now?"],["Tiphys","With the Oversight Committee officially involved, Lukmund will likely restrain himself."],["Tiphys","At the very least, he won't dare trigger the remaining pulse weapons."],["Elise","So first... we're preparing to make a trip to the Central Mining Area."],["Kaidan","...Is that so?"],["","...To see Phoenix one last time. She didn't have to put it into words."],["Kaidan","Then it looks like here is where we part ways."],["Tiphys","I'll lean on my network for intel on Lukmund and Ada. If anything turns up, you'll hear it first."],["Tiphys","Take care, GKD Squad. When we meet again, I hope it'll be in more pleasant circumstances."],["","Central Mining Area, Vesper Base"],["Vesper Warrior","......"],["Ovett Mercenary","...Hmph."],["","Outside the operations room, Vesper and the mercenaries maintain a certain distance. Although no weapons have been raised, they remain vigilant of each other."],["","They are waiting for a code that could be issued at any moment. Inside the operations room, the negotiations do not seem to be going smoothly."],["Lorenzo","I'm sorry, Mr. Yevgeny."],["Lorenzo","We appreciate your timely support and acknowledge your resistance against the UNCS and DL, but—"],["Lorenzo","Vesper is unwilling and will not become a vassal of any power."],["Yevgeny","The resistance has become the puppet of the UNCS Viceroy, while mercenary groups and underworld outfits have been all but destroyed. Though this has been taking place in West Milkhama, it mirrors the transformation taking place island-wide."],["Yevgeny","And Vesper, your situation is even worse... Main forces lost, supplies scarce, the front line is shrinking, and you've even lost your leader."],["","Lorenzo's gaze instantly turns ice cold. Though he doesn't make a move, Goman still feels his hostility."],["","Even so, Goman calmly continues speaking."],["Yevgeny","It's only a matter of time before the DL's local forces make a large-scale move, and Free Milkhama has also shown a tendency to lean toward the DL. Fight alone and you'll be picked apart, one by one."],["Yevgeny","If you mean to continue your resistance, you must unite with others to ride out the storm. Don't let pride be your downfall."],["Yevgeny","Vesper—work with us."],["Yevgeny","The Republic of Ovett will stand behind you."],["","Lorenzo frowns at these words, not because Goman's logic, but because of the country mentioned."],["Lorenzo","The Republic of <yellow>Ovett</yellow>? As far as I know, Ovett's a <yellow>principality</yellow>."],["Lorenzo","The \"Republic of Ovett\" was just a flash in the pan, suppressed and dissolved along with the revolutionary army at the end of the year-long revolution."],["","Being a mercenary, Lorenzo has traveled and fought in many parts of the world. Although he has never truly entered that secluded nation, he is aware of the rumors surrounding it."],["","Goman's version didn't add up."],["Yevgeny","The republic has not collapsed, and the revolutionary army has never stopped fighting. They're still resisting the oppression of the principality."],["","Faced with these doubts, Goman appeared completely unfazed, denying them calmly and firmly."],["Lorenzo","If that's the case, why did you leave the Principality of Ovett and come to Milkhama, thousands of miles away?"],["Lorenzo","Since the Milkhama War, Ovett has not made any political or military deployments on Milkhama. Whether to strike against the principality or to revitalize the revolutionary army, this island is not necessary."],["Lorenzo","What exactly is your purpose?"],["Yevgeny","Since you know about the Year of Revolution, you might have also heard about the war that occurred before it."],["Yevgeny","That war was the catalyst that shook Ovett—and the instigators were the UNCS and DL."],["Yevgeny","Later, it was also due to their intervention that the revolutionaries missed the best opportunity to take the initiative... The two superpowers have always been the enemies of the Ovettians."],["Lorenzo","...I see, so you hope to use the situation in Milkhama to hold back the two superpowers and create opportunities for the revolutionary army's actions in your country."],["Yevgeny","This is also an opportunity for Vesper."],["","Lorenzo doesn't respond. He simply continues to calmly watch Goman. Instead, someone speaks in his place—someone who shouldn't even be there."],["Cassha","Is it really that simple, Goman?"],["Yevgeny","...Cassha Lumiere."],["","He had specifically set up surveillance outposts, yet received no alert of Cassha's return—this raises Goman's guard, though he doesn't show it."],["Cassha","What you and the revolutionaries behind you lack is not just opportunity, but the power necessary to seize it—arashi mines and the technology from the Legacy are what you truly need."],["Cassha","And Vesper is just your next pawn, like the Ashes, no?"],["","Cassha shows no respect to Goman. As a Milkhaman, she is no stranger to the rise and fall of the Ashes."],["Cassha","Even if we manage to drive out the two superpowers with your help, Milkhama will just become an arena for the two factions of Ovett... which is not fundamentally different from the current situation."],["Cassha","So, please leave, Yevgeny Goman. We will not let the future of the Milkhaman people hinge on someone else's virtue or ambitions."],["Yevgeny","...So the talks are dead, then?"],["","Goman sighs, rises from his seat, and walks straight to the door."],["","He discreetly presses the button of the signal transmitter hidden in his clothes, sending a brief and unique signal to the Ovett mercenaries hidden throughout the mining area."],["Yevgeny","We didn't have to become enemies... It's truly regrettable."]],"441551301":[["","Within the Vesper Base, the chaos has not yet been completely quelled..."],["","Some are working hard to extinguish fires caused by the battle, some are repairing equipment damaged by stray bullets, and some are urgently bandaging the injured."],["","In addition, damaged STs intermittently rush out into battle after rough maintenance."],["","Tiphys and the others, led by Arthur, enter the base, and the sight before them hangs heavy in their hearts."],["Vesper Warrior","Arthur, you're okay—wait, those uniforms, are they from the DLAF!?"],["Vesper Warrior","Why did you bring the DLAF in here?"],["Arthur","They... I don't think they're enemies."],["Vesper Technician","How could they not be? Arthur, don't let them—"],["Cassha","They're Phoenix's family."],["","The sudden remark cut through the rising doubts, leaving the room stunned."],["","Surprise, warmth, suspicion, sympathy... countless gazes filled with countless emotions converge on Elise and Tiphys."],["","Cassha also slowly approaches, and Arthur immediately notices that her movements are somewhat unnatural."],["Arthur","Cassha, you're hurt!?"],["Cassha","It's nothing, just a stray bullet grazed my leg in the previous battle. Not a big deal."],["","Cassha briefly reassures Arthur and walks over to Tiphys and the others."],["Cassha","Welcome, Rear Admiral Tiphys, Dr. Elise, and all members of Squad 08."],["Tiphys","...You were attacked. Was this also Goman's doing?"],["Cassha","He's a dangerous man with ambitions different from those of the UNCS or the DL."],["Cassha","But Vesper won't kneel."],["","Cassha turns around and walks toward another area. A severely damaged ST stands by the wall, and upon closer inspection, a mostly obscured security door can be seen behind it."],["","Elise recognizes that it is Cassha's own ST, and considering her injuries... it is likely she was protecting the area behind this door."],["Cassha","Follow me, I'll take you to see Phoenix."],["","Behind the security door are rows of life support pods in a row. It turns out to be a medical wing for the gravely wounded."],["Cassha","...Right over there."],["","Tiphys cannot help but quicken his pace, passing through Vesper's doctors and wounded to reach the deepest part of the room."],["Tiphys","Phoenix!"],["","Naturally, there is no response. Phoenix lies quietly in the life support pod."],["","The opaque hull obscures the view, making it impossible to see his entire body. Even so, the missing parts of his body and the horrifying scars on his face are still discernible."],["Elise","Hng...!"],["","Elise can only let out a voiceless wail. Casting a pleading look at her father, she receives only silence in return."],["","The indicator light beside her keeps flashing, mercilessly emphasizing the conclusion of \"no vital signs.\""],["Cassha","He was severely injured. His heart had already stopped when he was separated from Apophis."],["Cassha","We tried everything we could, but still..."],["","Sadness and helplessness fill her heart, and with each word Cassha speaks, her tone grows heavier, finally turning into a sigh."],["Cassha","...We plan to bury him tomorrow."],["","There is no response, and in the silence, only the noise of emergency medical care in the background can be heard, almost drowning out Elise's soft sobs."],["","Cassha knows they both need time to accept the reality of the situation. She has experienced similar pain before."],["Cassha","...It's a good thing you made it."],["","After speaking, she slowly walks outside, leaving only the Mills."],["","XC 119, March 7, East Milkhama Governor's Office"],["","Lukmund connects to a highly-classified communication channel. A two-minute countdown displays in the corner of the communicator's screen, indicating the automatic cut-off and line switch required for such top-secret exchanges."],["","He hates the ritual, but has no choice—the other party holds operational privileges beyond even a governor's leash."],["Ada","Governor, did you need something from me?"],["Lukmund","Captain Ada, I am here to express my gratitude."],["Lukmund","I'd like to thank you. Your actions stopped the rebels and spies attacking the Fardan Research Institute from getting their hands on the Legacy. You may have prevented destruction on an unprecedented scale."],["Ada","Just doing my job."],["Lukmund","The Legacy is crucial to the DL, and now that we've luckily reclaimed it... I think we should place it a state of absolute security."],["Lukmund","Security Maintenance Force HQ has multiple armored mobile squadrons on station and a full defense grid. It's the safest vault."],["Ada","I understand your concerns and agree with your decision to transfer the Legacy... However, we are currently on an urgent mission and cannot proceed with the handover immediately."],["Ada","After the mission is completed, we will contact you at the first opportunity to transfer the Legacy."],["Lukmund","...What kind of urgent mission requires the deployment of the entire Reversion Squad?"],["Ada","I'm sorry, we cannot disclose the details of the mission. But rest assured, the Reversion Squad will never allow anyone to seize or destroy the Legacy."],["","*beep-beep* The system issues a prompt that the validity of this temporary communication is about to end."],["Lukmund","...Very well. I'll await good news, Captain Ada."],["","After the communication ends, Lukmund's expression quickly darkens."],["Lukmund","Ada Diaz, Captain of the Reversion Squad, a super pilot of the DL... Her actions don't seem to be the will of the Oceanic Conclave and the military."],["Lukmund","...We must send someone to keep an eye on them."]]};
